              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>1) &quot;40-20-40 with iOS14.5 Fix&quot; and &quot;Calibrated with iOS14.5 Fix&quot; numbers are provided weekly basis. Checking them monthly or daily might cause discrepancies. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>2) These values are updated every Wednesday at 2:00 AM so previous week&apos;s results must be checked on Wednesday or afterward.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
